  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Drought Recovery and Rehabilitation in Enderta and Degua Tembien Woredas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The existing practice on conservation of natural resources will be facilitated through production of different types of seedlings for reforestation and gabion mesh for gully rehabilitation.
Improved household income through diversified means including small stock production, honey production, high value crops production through expanded agribusiness approach.
Improved access to water for home consumption and sanitation in the targeted area.</narrative>
  </description>
